    "coping_width_m": 0.35,
    "note": "wall_below_water_m (0.80) and coping_width_m (0.35) are typical narrow-canal figures, not a cited gauge at Tib Lock 89. For way 243445859 the coping sits at the context paving elevation (road_27605679 world Y ~0.11 m at the canal edge) and the water is at -0.91 m from canal.json, so the visible drop is ~1.02 m (sourced from those two elevations, not from a CRT gauge). water_below_coping_m is kept as a fallback for other basins."
  },
  "covering_meshes": {
    "desktop": "web/context_typed_opt.glb node road_27605679 (material Paving.001). The name is one OSM footway (way 27605679, Sidney-Street area) but the mesh is a merged paved surface of 86,950 verts covering a large area, including the canal behind Barclay House, at Y 0.11\u20135.5 m \u2014 at and above the water. road_783670 (Asphalt.001, Sidney Street) also overlaps in places.",
    "mobile": "web/context_mo.glb nodes Terrain_EA_DTM (Ground) and the same paved/road meshes. Terrain Y 0.57\u20135.47 m over the canal. A canal_28047773 mesh exists but is largely under the terrain.",
